WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:02.130
(audience claps)

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.350
- The last time you were
here, what was it to promote?

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.183
Oh, the album!

00:00:05.183 --> 00:00:06.016
- [Cam] Yes.

00:00:06.016 --> 00:00:06.979
- Okay, now you're touring

00:00:06.979 --> 00:00:07.812
and your daughter is touring with you.

00:00:07.812 --> 00:00:08.645
How old is she?

00:00:08.645 --> 00:00:12.240
- Yeah, she's 2 1/2 and
yeah, she's adorable.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.770
- Probably got her own place by now,

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:14.673
living on her own.

00:00:14.673 --> 00:00:15.506
(Cam laughs)

00:00:15.506 --> 00:00:16.680
They grow up so quickly.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.840
- I know these past few
years have felt like 18 years

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:19.950
at this point.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.080
No, she's adorable.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.800
I don't quite know how to
pull off touring on a bus.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.680
She's pretty fearless, but
I think things that move

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.550
without her control,

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.290
that's like not her favorite thing.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:34.581
So I'm hoping she'll like
sleep in a bed with me

00:00:34.581 --> 00:00:35.414
and be okay.

00:00:35.414 --> 00:00:37.080
- And is it like, "Mommy,
why is the house keep moving?

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.105
- Yeah-

00:00:38.105 --> 00:00:38.938
(Cam laughs)
Probably.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.561
- "Do we owe money, why do we keep moving?

00:00:40.561 --> 00:00:41.394
"Why do we"-

00:00:41.394 --> 00:00:42.556
(Jay and Cam laugh)

00:00:42.556 --> 00:00:43.860
Now, speaking of families,

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.050
I heard yours is very competitive.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:46.883
Is that fair to say?

00:00:46.883 --> 00:00:47.940
- Yes.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.230
Yes, I think it's pretty fair.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.360
We play games like pinochle, I don't know

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.193
if you play pinochle?

00:00:52.193 --> 00:00:53.026
- Oh, pinochle, yeah.

00:00:53.026 --> 00:00:54.660
That's like a old-

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:55.723
- Well we got some old people in the-

00:00:55.723 --> 00:00:56.720
- You're saying I should play it.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:58.050
- I'd like to learn, I
think it needs a comeback.

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:58.883
That's what that sounds like.

00:00:58.883 --> 00:01:01.440
- Then we had like great
grandparents would play

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.030
with grandparents, with parents.

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:05.160
So everybody gets around this one table

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.690
and it gets really intense.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.010
- So great grandparents play with

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.210
grandparents play with parents.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:10.491
So it's all old people.

00:01:10.491 --> 00:01:12.330
(guest laughs)

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:15.180
There's nobody under 80,
apparently, in this game.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:16.320
- Pretty much.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:20.070
I mean we had a boxing bell installed

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:21.690
above the table where you play.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:24.780
So, as you hit like a
really high bid, ding!

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:26.160
Or if you win, ding!

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.930
- So in case anybody's sleeping,

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:28.763
that'll wake them up!

00:01:28.763 --> 00:01:29.596
- Yes, yeah, yeah.

00:01:29.596 --> 00:01:30.429
No.

00:01:30.429 --> 00:01:31.980
The things that are screamed at the table,

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:32.970
no one's sleeping.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:34.230
- Is that what this video was?

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.430
Is this your dad ringing the bell?

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:36.741
Let's take a look.

00:01:36.741 --> 00:01:39.990
(bell chimes)

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:41.478
- Adorable.

00:01:41.478 --> 00:01:42.430
(guest sighs)

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:43.263
(Jay mumbles)

00:01:43.263 --> 00:01:44.096
That's amazing.

00:01:44.096 --> 00:01:45.152
- Waiting for the game
to begin, apparently.

00:01:45.152 --> 00:01:46.073
- Yeah, yeah.

